  "generated": "---\ntitle: \"Working with call recordings\"\nslug: \"/apps/desktop-working-with-call-recordings--ssv2vm6rzstcim2xd99giaun\"\nmdx: {\"format\":\"md\"}\ntags: [\"Desktop\",\"General\",\"desktop\",\"working-with-calls\"]\n---\n\n> Availability of this feature depends on your service configuration. Contact support for details.\n\n*Looking for an&#x20;*[*iOS*](/docs/apps/ios-listening-sharing-recording--s99acnxuit527m1nl2j386zg) *or&#x20;*[*Android*](/docs/apps/android-listening-sharing-recording--x7bkxmsy46nq43zq88sa8noh) *version of this article?*\n\n**To playback a call recording**:\n\n1. Open your conversation history with a contact.\n2. Find a call you would like to listen to and press the![App icon](/img/ringotel/original/92be778f8f70c2ed28b4/1a9c0951d18d87c7e269e211587604ca5d60ec3b42c65f796ab7435c55709051.png)icon.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/53ef114c2287cee61a23/03898c26164e52d60f57d52872d95eca8081aa0149d9dd1837daa3661a7c21df.png)\n\n**To download a call recording**:\n\n1. Open your conversation history with a contact.\n2. Find a call recording that you would like to download and press the **View Details&#x20;**&#x6C;ink.\n3. Click on the![App icon](/img/ringotel/original/aaea83b3af41c2fa3303/cdcc260ea59d09a90283a563443ad4557157fdfe1a119fb54e1357191e88f0e3.png)icon to save this call’s recording to your computer.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/3adf986f3434377d080e/b38ec193d7fa64d5a467bd572283b55404b1e4a821571e2247095e35a63e6dd5.png)\n\n*\\* Please check the availability of this feature with your PBX Administrator.*\n\n## Related articles\n\n- [Viewing and sharing a call recording](/docs/apps/ios-listening-sharing-recording--s99acnxuit527m1nl2j386zg)\n"
